   "lines": [
    "Rainy, so we stayed in",
    "camp, reading, playing",
    "whist and cleaning",
    "our guns. We have",
    "quite a varied diet",
    "— duck, partridge, trout",
    "pickerel &c.",
    "In the afternoon Em",
    "and I watched (from",
    "behind some bushes)",
    "the river, in hopes of",
    "some ducks passing",
    "by; but after sitting",
    "about three hours in",
    "the rain we returned",
    "with nothing."
   ],
